--   - `MIPStarRE.QPBT.extractionEprFirstEquiv`: moves each extracted register before its auxiliary registers.
--   - `MIPStarRE.QPBT.Extraction.eprPartialInner`: defines the partial inner product with the EPR vector, leaving the auxiliary index.
--   - `MIPStarRE.QPBT.ProjectiveSetting.extractionAuxReference`: defines the normalized reference vector on the auxiliary registers formed from the original state and one EPR pair.
--   - `MIPStarRE.QPBT.ProjectiveSetting.extractionEprProjection`: defines the EPR projection on the extracted registers with identity on the auxiliary registers.
--   - `MIPStarRE.QPBT.ProjectiveSetting.extractionAux0`: defines the auxiliary vector before normalization obtained by EPR contraction.
